Z||000000||87GT||02-27-2001||09:00 PM||||I was just wondering if there is a way to fix the windows to where they go all the way down.  Mine stick up about a 1/2 inch on each side when down.  I understand from others that this is a common fiero problem.  Is there any way to fix it?  Thanks.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
